    "text": "<p>The conductivity of a semiconductor is given by<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.6</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.01</mo></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1.05</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.65</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
